{"strongs": "H8415", "word": "תִּהוֺם", "translit": "te.hom", "root": "תהום", "morph": "H:N", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "deep, sea, abyss", "definition": "תִּהוֺם noun feminine Gen 7:11 + 7 t. and masculine Job 28:14 + 5 t. ( Albr ZAW xvi (1896), 62 Kö ii. 2. 167 Ency. Bib . DEEP ) deep, sea, abyss (almost always in poetry); — absolute ׳ ת Gen 1:2 +; plural absolute תְּהֹמוֺת Ps 77:17 +, etc., ׳ בַּתּ Isa 63:13 + Isa 106:9 (only here with article); construct תְּהוֺמוֺת Isa 71:20 (but see 5 infra); — 1. deep , of subterranean waters, Gen 49:25 (poem in J ; opposed to שָׁמַיִם ), Deut 33:13 (opposed to id. ); ׳ רַבָּה מַעְיְנוֺת ת Gen 7:11 ; Gen 8:2 ( P ; || אֲרֻבֹּת הַשָּׁמַיִם ), ׳ עִינוֺת ת Prov 8:28 (|| שְׁחָקִים ), Job 28:14 ; Job 38:16 (both || יָם ); תְּהוֺם רַבָּה Amos 7:4 (probably), רַבָּה ׳ מִשְׁפָּטֶיךָ ת Ps 36:7 (opposed to אֵל צִדְקָֽתְךָ כְּהַרְרֵי ), Isa 51:10 (perhaps); so plural תְּהֹמוֺת , Prov 8:24 (|| מַעְיָנוֺת ), Prov 3:20 (opposed to שְׁחָקִים ), and probably Ps 33:7 (|| מֵי הַיָּם ), Ps 135:6 ( + יַמִּים ). 2. (deep) sea , overwhelming Tyre Ezek 26:19 (|| הַמַּיִם הָרַבִּים ), roaring at theoph. Hab 3:10 in general, || יָם , Job 38:30 ( ׳ פְּנֵי ת ); || מַיִם Jonah 2:6 alonE Job 41:24 figurative, קוֺרַא ׳ אֶלתֿ ׳ ת Job 42:8 (|| מִשְׁבָּרִים , גַּלִּים ; but possibly here of Jordan, compare 4 ); in plural = abysses of sea, Exod 15:5 ; Exod 15:8 (of Red Sea, so) Isa 63:13 || Ps 106:9 ; Ps 77:17 also Ps 78:15 (in simile), Ps 107:26 (poetic of hollows of great waves, opposed to שָׁמַיִם ); vaguely, כָּלתְּֿהֹמוֺת Ps 135:6 ; Ps 148:7 . 3. primaeval ocean, deep , in Hebrew cosmogony, ׳ פְּנֵי ת Gen 1:2 ( P ; || פְּנֵי הַמַּיִם ), Prov 8:27 (|| שָׁמַיִם ), Ps 104:6 . — (compare, further, Gunk Schöpfung u. Chaos 21 ff. OCWhitehouse Hast. DB COSMOGONY Zim KAT3. 492 f., 509 f., 585 ). 4. deep, depth , of river Ezek 31:4 (Nile; || מַיִם , + נַהֲרוֺתֶיהָ ), v Ezek 31:15 (|| id. ); plural of bursts of water fertilizing Canaan, יוצאים בבקעה ובהר Deut 8:7 ( + עֲיָנֹת , נַחֲלֵי מַיִם ). — On Ps 42:8 see 2. 5. abyss (si vera lectio): תְּהוֺמוֺת הָאָרֶץ = Shejôl , Ps 71:20 , but Ol We תַּחְתִיּוֺת . [ תַּחְפֻּכָה ] see הפך . תָּו see תוה . below, תּוֺא see תְּאוֺ . [ תּוֺאָם ] see תאם .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9115')\">BDB9115</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8415')\">H8415</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9114')\">BDB9114</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9116')\">BDB9116</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>תִּהוֺם</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Gen 7:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,7,11)\">Gen 7:11</ref> + 7 t.</sup> <b>and masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Job 28:14\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(18,28,14)\">Job 28:14</ref> + 5 t.</sup> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Albr.')\">Albr<sup>ZAW xvi (1896), 62</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kö')\">Kö<sup>ii. 2. 167 Ency. Bib</sup></lookup>.<sup>DEEP</sup>) <highlightword>deep, sea, abyss</highlightword> (almost always in poetry); — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 1:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,2)\">Gen 1:2</ref> +; plural absolute <bdbheb>תְּהֹמוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 77:17\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"77\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"77\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(19,77,17)\">Ps 77:17</ref> +, etc., <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בַּתּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 63:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"63\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"63\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,63,13)\">Isa 63:13</ref> + <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Isa 106:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"106\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"106\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,106,9)\">Isa 106:9</ref> (only here with article); construct <bdbheb>תְּהוֺמוֺת</bdbheb> <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Isa 71:20\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"71\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"71\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(23,71,20)\">Isa 71:20</ref> (but see <b>5</b> infra); — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>deep</highlight>, of subterranean waters, <ref ref=\"Gen 49:25\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(1,49,25)\">Gen 49:25</ref> (poem in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>; opposed to <bdbheb>שָׁמַיִם</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Deut 33:13\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(5,33,13)\">Deut 33:13</ref> (opposed to <highlight>id.</highlight>); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>רַבָּה מַעְיְנוֺת ת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 7:11\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(1,7,11)\">Gen 7:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 8:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,8,2)\">Gen 8:2</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>; || <bdbheb>אֲרֻבֹּת הַשָּׁמַיִם</bdbheb>), <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עִינוֺת ת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 8:28\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(20,8,28)\">Prov 8:28</ref> (|| <bdbheb>שְׁחָקִים</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Job 28:14\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(18,28,14)\">Job 28:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 38:16\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(18,38,16)\">Job 38:16</ref> (both || <bdbheb>יָם</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>תְּהוֺם רַבָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 7:4\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(30,7,4)\">Amos 7:4</ref> (probably), <bdbheb>רַבָּה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִשְׁפָּטֶיךָ ת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 36:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,36,7)\">Ps 36:7</ref> (opposed to <bdbheb>אֵל צִדְקָֽתְךָ כְּהַרְרֵי</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Isa 51:10\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(23,51,10)\">Isa 51:10</ref> (perhaps); so plural <bdbheb>תְּהֹמוֺת</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Prov 8:24\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(20,8,24)\">Prov 8:24</ref> (|| <bdbheb>מַעְיָנוֺת</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Prov 3:20\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(20,3,20)\">Prov 3:20</ref> (opposed to <bdbheb>שְׁחָקִים</bdbheb>), and probably <ref ref=\"Ps 33:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,33,7)\">Ps 33:7</ref> (|| <bdbheb>מֵי הַיָּם</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Ps 135:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"135\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"135\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,135,6)\">Ps 135:6</ref> ( + <bdbheb>יַמִּים</bdbheb>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> (deep) <highlight>sea</highlight>, overwhelming Tyre <ref ref=\"Ezek 26:19\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(26,26,19)\">Ezek 26:19</ref> (|| <bdbheb>הַמַּיִם הָרַבִּים</bdbheb>), roaring at theoph. <ref ref=\"Hab 3:10\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(35,3,10)\">Hab 3:10</ref> in general, || <bdbheb>יָם</bdbheb>, <ref ref=\"Job 38:30\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(18,38,30)\">Job 38:30</ref> (<bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>פְּנֵי ת</bdbheb>); || <bdbheb>מַיִם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jonah 2:6\" b=\"32\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(32,2,6)\">Jonah 2:6</ref> alonE <ref ref=\"Job 41:24\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(18,41,24)\">Job 41:24</ref> figurative, <bdbheb>קוֺרַא</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אֶלתֿ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 42:8\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(18,42,8)\">Job 42:8</ref> (|| <bdbheb>מִשְׁבָּרִים</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>גַּלִּים</bdbheb>; but possibly here of Jordan, compare <b>4</b>); in plural = <highlight>abysses</highlight> of sea, <ref ref=\"Exod 15:5\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(2,15,5)\">Exod 15:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 15:8\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(2,15,8)\">Exod 15:8</ref> (of Red Sea, so) <ref ref=\"Isa 63:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"63\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"63\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,63,13)\">Isa 63:13</ref> || <ref ref=\"Ps 106:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"106\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"106\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,106,9)\">Ps 106:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 77:17\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"77\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"77\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(19,77,17)\">Ps 77:17</ref> also <ref ref=\"Ps 78:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"78\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"78\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,78,15)\">Ps 78:15</ref> (in simile), <ref ref=\"Ps 107:26\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"107\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"107\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(19,107,26)\">Ps 107:26</ref> (poetic of hollows of great waves, opposed to <bdbheb>שָׁמַיִם</bdbheb>); vaguely, <bdbheb>כָּלתְּֿהֹמוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 135:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"135\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"135\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,135,6)\">Ps 135:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 148:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"148\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"148\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,148,7)\">Ps 148:7</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>primaeval ocean, deep</highlight>, in Hebrew cosmogony, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>פְּנֵי ת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 1:2\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,2)\">Gen 1:2</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>; || <bdbheb>פְּנֵי הַמַּיִם</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Prov 8:27\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(20,8,27)\">Prov 8:27</ref> (|| <bdbheb>שָׁמַיִם</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Ps 104:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"104\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"104\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,104,6)\">Ps 104:6</ref>. — (compare, further, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gunk')\">Gunk<sup>Schöpfung u. Chaos 21 ff.</sup></lookup> OCWhitehouse<sup>Hast. DB COSMOGONY</sup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Zim')\">Zim<sup>KAT3. 492 f., 509 f., 585</sup></lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <highlight>deep, depth</highlight>, of river <ref ref=\"Ezek 31:4\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(26,31,4)\">Ezek 31:4</ref> (Nile; || <bdbheb>מַיִם</bdbheb>, + <bdbheb>נַהֲרוֺתֶיהָ</bdbheb>), v<ref ref=\"Ezek 31:15\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(26,31,15)\">Ezek 31:15</ref> (|| <highlight>id.</highlight>); plural of <highlight>bursts</highlight> of water fertilizing Canaan, <bdbheb>יוצאים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>בבקעה ובהר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 8:7\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(5,8,7)\">Deut 8:7</ref> ( + <bdbheb>עֲיָנֹת</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>נַחֲלֵי מַיִם</bdbheb>). — On <ref ref=\"Ps 42:8\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(19,42,8)\">Ps 42:8</ref> see </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2. 5.</b> <highlight>abyss</highlight> (si vera lectio): <bdbheb>תְּהוֺמוֺת הָאָרֶץ</bdbheb> = <highlight>Shejôl</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Ps 71:20\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"71\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"71\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(19,71,20)\">Ps 71:20</ref>, but <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ol')\">Ol</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> <bdbheb>תַּחְתִיּוֺת</bdbheb>. </p></div><hr><p>[<bdbheb>תַּחְפֻּכָה</bdbheb>] see <bdbheb>הפך</bdbheb>. <bdbheb>תָּו</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>תוה</reflink></bdbheb>. below, </p><hr><p><bdbheb>תּוֺא</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>תְּאוֺ</reflink></bdbheb>. [<bdbheb>תּוֺאָם</bdbheb>] see  <bdbheb><reflink>תאם</reflink></bdbheb>. </p><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Gen 7:11", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 7, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Job 28:14", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 28, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Gen 1:2", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 1, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Ps 77:17", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 77, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Isa 63:13", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 63, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Isa 106:9", "book": "ISA", "cha